{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y明显削弱了音乐感受的细腻程度，尤其是X中随音乐节点出现的音色、节奏、力度变化及其对应的身体感受，很多被压缩成了概括性短词。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分区让故事线和音乐感受各有位置，左侧完整叙述使观众更容易迅速抓住人物当下的想法，以及想法变化的原因；从离开后的失落、对亲近的怀念、回去与否的挣扎，到接受矛盾并继续生活，前后因果也更容易连起来。X的优势是音乐感受明显更丰富、更细腻，尤其能呈现同一段音乐内部情绪和声音如何逐步变化，但大量交替出现的感受描述也更容易分散注意力。作为边听边扫的普通观众，我会选Y，代价是少了一些音乐细节和情绪层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ed2e3031-bad0-490a-9d00-0c4e090f25e9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163210903335Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:33:01.555463+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "382da324193a20cf66a56c47fcb44fb114a2dc3a20d653ee237adf6adb8a9a7b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa